{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":true,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Interviewcollectie Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië, interview 1258"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:49028"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Resp_Interviewnummer 1258.1"}},{"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Resp_Interviewnummer 1258.2"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië (SMGI)"}},{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Koninklijk Instituut voor Taal-, Land- en Volkenkunde (KITLV)"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KITLV  Archives"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KITLV \/ Leiden Universiteit UB"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Dit interview bestaat uit twee gesprekken: 1258.1 en 1258.2.<\/p><p>1258.1 De geïnterviewde groeide op in Indië. De geïnterviewde vertelt hoe hij het begin van de Japanse bezetting meemaakte. Zijn vader werd krijgsgevangene gemaakt en hijzelf kwam later met een groep jongens in een kamp. Hierna kwam de geïnterviewde in de gevangenis terecht waar hij een vreselijke tijd beleefde.<\/p><p>1258.2 De geïnterviewde vertelt verder over zijn ervaringen in de gevangenis. Hierna kwam hij in kamp Ambarawa. Hij beschrijft de situatie in het kamp en gaat in op de bevrijding.<\/p>"}},{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Date Submitted: 2012-03-01"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"dekolonisatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"koloniale samenleving"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Japanse bezetting"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Japanse capitulatie"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Bersiap"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"interneringskampen"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"KNIL"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nederlands Indië"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Indonesische onafhankelijkheid"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"1998-04-23"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Fridus Steijlen (coördinator)"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2011-08-24"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2012-03-01"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Deze dataset bevat de metadata van de interviewcollectie Stichting Mondelinge Geschiedenis Indonesië.<br>Een groep wetenschappers uit verschillende disciplines nam in 1994 het initiatief om de verhalen en ervaringen van mensen, die de turbulente laatkoloniale en vroeg-postkoloniale tijd tussen 1940-1962 in Nederlands-Indië, Indonesië of Nieuw-Guinea hadden meegemaakt, vast te leggen nu het nog kon. Men koos ervoor om geen onderzoeksproject op te zetten, maar om zich te concentreren op het verzamelen van de verhalen van mensen vanuit archiveringsoogpunt als basis voor toekomstig onderzoek. Tussen 1997 en 2001 zijn er 1190 interviews met 724 mensen opgenomen, in totaal 2800 uur aan geluidsmateriaal.<\/p><p>Een overzicht van het project en de interviews in EASY vindt u onder 'Data files'.<\/p><p>De interviews worden bij DANS duurzaam bewaard, maar worden (voorlopig) door het KITLV zelf ontsloten. Zie het veld 'Relations' voor een link naar de collectie op de KITLV-website.<\/p>"}}]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata"